ovement, skills, stages, and boss requirements into a short checklist.","Open the exact source archive and follow character selection into the three level scenes.","Choose one requirement to revise with an agent, then replay the relevant stage and check for regressions.","AI 工作流与开发背景","这个作者发布的 OpenGame 案例把详细动作游戏提示词、在线结果和生成源码连接起来。应将实现与简报逐项比较，而不把提示词本身当成所有功能正常的证据。","aiUse","创作方式","AI 生成（创作者归属）","category","引擎","Phaser 3 · TypeScript","ai-generated",[215,216,217,218],{"_56":210,"_26":184,"_18":205},{"_56":200,"_26":158,"_18":196,"_185":201},{"_56":192,"_26":193,"_185":194,"_236":237},{"_56":183,"_26":184,"_185":186},[123,234,235],"codex-browser-games","playwright-mcp","scope","complete-project",{"_239":240},"documents",{"_65":241,"_36":242},[244,248,249,250,247,251,252,253,254,255,256,257,258,259,260,261,262,263,264,265,266,267,268,269,270,271,272,273,274,275,276,277,278,279,280,281,282,246,283,245,284,285,286,287,288,289,290,291,292,293,294,295,296,297,298,299,300,301],[243,244,245,246,247],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-design/LICENSE",